@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 0
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
}

actor "Staff user" as U
participant "Navbar\n(Web Panel)" as UI
participant "AuthController" as AC
participant "RefreshToken\nService" as RT
participant "Password\nHelper" as PH
database "AppDbContext" as DB

U -> UI : current + new +\nconfirm password
UI -> UI : next.length >= 8 and\nnext == confirm (else\ninline error, no request)
UI -> AC : POST /api/auth/\nchange-password\n{currentPassword,\nnewPassword}
AC -> DB : Users.Find(userId from JWT)
AC -> PH : VerifyPassword(current,\nSalt, PasswordHash)
break current password wrong
  AC -> DB : AuditLog PASSWORD_CHANGE_FAILED
  AC --> UI : 400 "Current password\nis incorrect."
else new password shorter than 8
  AC --> UI : 400 "at least\n8 characters"
end
AC -> RT : RevokeOtherSessionsAsync\n(userId, jti, PasswordChanged)
RT -> DB : RefreshTokens of every\nother family revoked
RT -> DB : other UserSessions\nIsRevoked = true
RT --> AC : (revokedRefreshTokens,\nrevokedSessions)
AC -> PH : GenerateSalt();\nHashPassword(new, salt)
PH --> AC : PBKDF2 hash
AC -> DB : update User.Salt + PasswordHash;\nAuditLog PASSWORD_CHANGED; SaveChanges
AC --> UI : 200 "Password updated\nsuccessfully."
UI --> U : success\nmessage
note over UI, DB : The caller's own session and refresh-token family stay valid.
@enduml
